Quests of Grim
    Events
        Player - Player 1 (Red) Selects a unit
    Conditions
        (Triggering unit) Equal to Grim
        (Distance between (Position of Grim) and (Position of Nazgrek)) Less than or equal to 500.00
        (Remaining time for DialogOverTimer) Equal to 0.00
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        -------- ======== CINEMATIC STARTS ======== --------
        Trigger - Run Cinematic ON <gen> (checking conditions)
        -------- Camera --------
        Cinematic - Turn cinematic mode On for (All players)
        Camera - Pan camera for Player 1 (Red) to (Position of Grim) over 1.00 seconds
        Camera - Apply GrimCamera01 <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 0.00 seconds
        Wait 1.00 seconds
        Unit - Make Grim face Nazgrek over 0.75 seconds
        Unit - Make Nazgrek face Grim over 0.75 seconds
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
            Then - Actions
                -------- NORMAL DIALOG --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        GrimDialog01FarewellBoolean Equal to False
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- If the Player has previosly not declined the quest --------
                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Grim named Grim: Play OrcPeon_0022 <gen> and display Me want tooth of a ....  Modify duration: Set to 6.00 seconds and Wait
                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Grim named Grim: Play OrcPeon_0023 <gen> and display Can you fetch me a ....  Modify duration: Set to 4.00 seconds and Wait
                    Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        GrimDialog01FarewellBoolean Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Grim named Grim: Play OrcPeon_0020 <gen> and display Yes? What is it?.  Modify duration: Set to 2.00 seconds and Wait
                    Else - Actions
